/v1/","context":{"app_id":3555440,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-3555440","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:55:05Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4329500","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3555440-1844115010492573","game_id":"steam-3555440","kind":"announcement","title":"Lich Lords Demo Release!","summary":"The Lich Lords Demo is Now Available!After many months of updates, changes, and playtesting, the Lich Lords demo is now available on Steam!A huge thank you to everyone who played during the playtest period and took the time to leave feedback, report bugs, and share suggestions. A lot has changed and improved thanks to your feedback, from combat and progression to the tutorial, environments, balance, performance, and more.There is still a long way to go before the full game is finished, and the d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T16:04:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010492573","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3555440-1839676055894890","game_id":"steam-3555440","kind":"announcement","title":"New Trailer Announcement","summary":"Hello!We've just released a new trailer for Lich Lords, showing many of the new changes we've made since we released our playtest. This features new bosses, skills/spells, improved combat, and more. Check it out on our Steam page now! Many of these changes have come as a direct result of the feedback we've received from the playtest. The playtest is still live and being constantly updated, so be sure to try it out and leave any suggestions or feedback in the Steam discussions to help shape the g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T14:29:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055894890","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3555440-1828894815563022","game_id":"steam-3555440","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.2.0","summary":"Hello,We've released a big update for Lich Lords. A lot of the changes have come from the closed beta feedback. This update will be available for those who signed up for and have access to the closed beta. We are currently working hard to launch the public open Steam playtest soon, so sign up for that if you want to be notified when that goes live!\\-Improved enemy telegraph attacks-Fixed a bug where some \"low down\" enemies like dogs were hard to hit-Fixed a bug where some low down enemies would ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-05T00:22:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815563022","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3555440-1825727806713886","game_id":"steam-3555440","kind":"update","title":"Beta Update 0.1.3","summary":"Hello!We've just released a big new update for those who have signed up to beta test Lich Lords. The update should be live shortly after the time of this announcement. Many of the new fixes and changes were directly inspired by the current reports from beta testing, so keep reporting bugs and suggesting new features if you want to see them!NEW FEATURE: BOSSESPortals to new areas are now locked off until you defeat the area boss. Area bosses drop lots of loot/items and a Mutation Power (see below","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-28T19:24:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806713886","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3555440-1816849002012595","game_id":"steam-3555440","kind":"announcement","title":"Lich Lords - Beta Testing Announcement!","summary":"One day, you awake to find the warmth of your human body and flesh gone, replaced with cold bone. Your memory is a blur of vague glimpses of humanity. You find yourself in a strange, eldritch realm. You have become a Lich, and now you're in an endless cycle where Liches fight to the death for supremacy, until only one remains - the \"Lich Lord\" - only for the cycle to begin again...Hello!Beta testing for Lich Lords will begin next month! All who signed up for beta testing in our Steam discussions","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-21T01:36:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816849002012595","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3555440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:48Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:47Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3555440":"2026-10-26T00:41:48Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3555440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4329500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:48Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:48Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3555440","app_id":3555440,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:18Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"korean